versions and updates (SPEC 8.1; the last two and \`versions --remote\` contact the app's registry):
  versions <id> [--remote] [--json]     installed versions, current, update choice, source;
                                        --remote also lists the versions in the registry
  use <id> <version>                    switch to an installed version (going back warns, and sets "manual")
